## East West Diamond Engagement Ring: $1,635 to $2,600

The East West Diamond Engagement Ring steps up from the plain solitaire with additional design detailing on the shank or setting head. At $1,635 in 14k gold and $2,600 in platinum, this is the mid-range east-west option — more architectural presence than the simple solitaire without the added stone weight of the pavé style.

