## East West Sidestone & Pavé: $1,840 to $2,485

The East West Sidestone and Pavé setting adds 1/4 ct tw of diamond accents to the east-west concept. The pavé diamonds run along the band or frame the center stone. This is the most reviewed east-west style in this lineup — 28 reviews across all four metal versions, compared to 4 or 7 for the other styles.

Buyers who buy it tend to be satisfied with it.

