> **Farzana says:** "The pavé east-west is the one I recommend for buyers who love the east-west concept but are worried the solitaire looks 'too plain.' The pavé diamonds balance the architectural step-cut center stone without overwhelming it. 28 reviews across all metals — that review count tells you buyers actually love wearing it."

