## Total Ring Cost: Setting + Stone

The total ring cost is the setting price plus the certified stone price. Certified market data for [emerald cut diamonds](/loose-emerald-cut-diamond) shows 1ct natural GIA stones at G-VS2 running approximately $2,800–$3,500 depending on exact cut and report parameters. Lab-grown 1ct IGI stones at F-VVS1 run approximately $450–$600.

