**Buyers concerned about durability:** The [East West Solitaire in Platinum at $1,475](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-solitaire-in-platinum-item-193753?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the practical choice for daily wear. East-west prong placement takes more lateral force than north-south. Platinum's density and resistance to bending keeps those prongs secure longer than 14k gold alternatives.

